      "zh": "大卫说：「弟兄们，耶和华所赐给我们的，不可不分给他们；因为他保佑我们，将那攻击我们的敌军交在我们手里。",
      "en": "But David said, “No! You shouldn’t do this, my brothers. Look at what the Lord has given us![NOTE:1] He has protected us and has delivered into our hands the raiding party that came against us.",
